#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:3
msgid "Command-line options"
msgstr "命令行参数"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:5
msgid ""
"Each tool's options are documented on its own User guide page, grouped by "
"purpose rather than as a flat alphabetical list:"
msgstr "每个工具的参数在各自的使用指南页面中按用途分组说明，而不是按字母顺序平铺："

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:8
msgid ""
"[`cnets` options](../user-guide/cnets.md#options) — tree generation, "
"mutation model, event rates, branch-specific rates."
msgstr "[`cnets` 参数](../user-guide/cnets.md#options)：树的生成、突变模型、事件速率、分支特异速率。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:10
msgid ""
"[`cnetml` options](../user-guide/cnetml.md#options) — time constraints, "
"evolutionary model, independent Markov chain dimensions, tree search, "
"mutation types."
msgstr ""
"[`cnetml` 参数](../user-guide/cnetml.md#options)：时间约束、演化模型、independent Markov "
"chain 维度、树搜索、突变类型。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:13
msgid ""
"[`cnetmcmc` options](../user-guide/cnetmcmc.md#options) — reference "
"tree/init tree, and everything read from `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`."
msgstr ""
"[`cnetmcmc` 参数](../user-guide/cnetmcmc.md#options)：参考树/初始树，以及从 "
"`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg` 读取的全部参数。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:16
msgid ""
"For every `cnets` and `cnetml` option in one table, with short forms, "
"defaults and accepted values, see the [Command-line options "
"reference](options.md)."
msgstr "`cnets` 和 `cnetml` 全部参数的简写、默认值和可选值汇总表，见[命令行参数参考](options.md)。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:26
msgid "Run scripts and config files"
msgstr "运行脚本和配置文件"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:28
msgid ""
"The driver scripts live in `bin/`, next to the compiled programs, and their "
"configuration in `config/`:"
msgstr "运行脚本放在 `bin/` 中，和编译好的程序在一起；它们的配置放在 `config/` 中："

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:41
msgid "Run scripts"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:43
msgid ""
"The current pattern is: **edit the script, don't type flags by hand.** Each "
"`bin/run-*.sh` sets its tool's options as shell variables in a block at the "
"top of the file (input paths, model parameters, etc.), then builds the "
"command line from those variables. To run with different settings, copy the "
"relevant script (or edit it in place) and change the variable values — see "
"the \"Examples\" section on each tool's [User guide](../user-guide/index.md)"
" page."
msgstr ""
"目前的做法是：**修改脚本，不要手动输入参数。** 每个 `bin/run-*.sh` 都在文件顶部用 shell "
"变量设置该工具的参数（输入路径、模型参数等），再用这些变量拼出命令行。要换一组设置运行，就复制对应的脚本（或直接修改），改变量的值，见各工具[使用指南"
"](../user-guide/index.md)页面的\"示例\"部分。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:51
msgid ""
"The scripts find the programs, `config/` and `util/` relative to the "
"repository, so they can be run from any directory. Output goes to "
"`CNETA_OUT` (default `./example`), which is relative to the directory you "
"run them from — usually the top of the repository:"
msgstr ""
"脚本按仓库的相对位置查找程序、`config/` 和 `util/`，所以可以在任何目录下运行。输出写到 `CNETA_OUT`（默认 "
"`./example`），它相对于运行脚本时所在的目录，通常是仓库顶层："

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:60
msgid "Shared settings: `config/common.conf`"
msgstr "共用设置：`config/common.conf`"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:62
msgid ""
"Sourced by all three scripts before anything else. It holds settings that "
"belong to a whole pipeline run rather than to one tool:"
msgstr "三个脚本在执行任何操作之前都会先 source 它。其中保存的是属于整个流程而不是某一个工具的设置："

