msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`CNETA_OUT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid ""
"Working directory. `cnets` writes its simulated data here; `cnetml` and "
"`cnetmcmc` read their input from here and write their results alongside."
msgstr "工作目录。`cnets` 把模拟数据写到这里；`cnetml` 和 `cnetmcmc` 从这里读取输入，并把结果写在同一位置。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`./example`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`CNETA_SEED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid ""
"Random seed. Empty (or 0) means a new random seed for every run. Set a "
"number to reproduce a run; see [Reproducing a run](#reproducing-a-run)."
msgstr "随机种子。为空（或 0）表示每次运行使用新的随机种子。设为某个数可以重现一次运行，见[重现一次运行](#reproducing-a-run)。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It is read by the shell, so use shell syntax: no spaces around `=`. Write "
"each setting as `VAR=\"${VAR:-value}\"`, so that a value set in the "
"environment still takes precedence over the file."
msgstr ""
"该文件由 shell 读取，所以要用 shell 语法：`=` 两边不能有空格。每项设置写成 "
"`VAR=\"${VAR:-value}\"`，这样环境变量中设定的值仍然优先于文件。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:74
msgid "Environment overrides"
msgstr "用环境变量覆盖"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:76
msgid ""
"Every setting can be overridden for a single run from the environment, e.g. "
"`CNETA_SEED=42 bin/run-cnets.sh`. The order of precedence is: environment, "
"then `config/common.conf`, then the script's own default."
msgstr ""
"每项设置都可以通过环境变量对单次运行覆盖，例如 `CNETA_SEED=42 bin/run-cnets.sh`。优先级为：环境变量 > "
"`config/common.conf` > 脚本自身的默认值。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "Used by"
msgstr "使用者"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "all scripts"
msgstr "所有脚本"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "a new random seed each run"
msgstr "每次运行使用新的随机种子"

