msgid "`bin/` in the repository"
msgstr "仓库中的 `bin/`"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`CNETA_CONFIG_DIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`config/` in the repository"
msgstr "仓库中的 `config/`"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`CNETA_CONFIG`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`run-cnetmcmc.sh`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:20
msgid "`$CNETA_CONFIG_DIR/cnet_mcmc.cfg`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:88
msgid "Reproducing a run"
msgstr "重现一次运行"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:90
msgid ""
"Every script passes the seed to the program on every invocation and records "
"it twice: as the first line of the log (`seed <number>`), and as a line in "
"`seed-history.txt` in the working directory, which is appended to and never "
"overwritten, so the record survives re-running with the same settings. "
"Bootstrap replicates and MCMC chains use the seed plus 1, 2, ... and each is"
" recorded under its own log name."
msgstr ""
"每个脚本每次调用程序时都会传入种子，并记录两次：一次在日志第一行（`seed <number>`），一次在工作目录的 `seed-"
"history.txt` 中追加一行。该文件只追加、不覆盖，所以用相同设置重新运行后记录仍然保留。Bootstrap 重复和 MCMC 链使用种子加 "
"1、2……，每个都记录在各自的日志名下。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:97
msgid ""
"The programs also print the seed they actually used, as `seed:` followed by "
"a tab and the number, including the clock-based seed they pick when called "
"directly without `--seed`. The record also travels with the data: `cnets` "
"writes its seeds at the top of `<prefix>-info.txt`, and `cnetml` writes its "
"seed into `<output>.summary.txt`, whatever launched them."
msgstr ""
"程序本身也会打印实际使用的种子，格式为 `seed:` 加制表符和数字；直接调用程序且没有指定 `--seed` "
"时，打印的是根据时钟选取的种子。种子记录也会随数据一起保存：无论程序由谁启动，`cnets` 都把种子写在 `<prefix>-info.txt` "
"开头，`cnetml` 把种子写进 `<output>.summary.txt`。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:103
msgid ""
"To repeat a run, put that number in front of the script, e.g. "
"`CNETA_SEED=<number> bin/run-cnetml.sh`, or pass `--seed <number>` when "
"calling a program directly. The same seed and the same input give the same "
"result whatever the number of OpenMP threads, and the random choices no "
"longer depend on the C++ standard library, so they are the same on a Mac and"
" on the HPC. The test suite checks on both Linux and macOS that the results "
"agree."
msgstr ""
"要重复一次运行，把这个数放在脚本前面，例如 `CNETA_SEED=<number> bin/run-cnetml.sh`；直接调用程序时传 "
"`--seed <number>`。相同的种子和相同的输入，无论 OpenMP 线程数是多少，结果都相同；随机选择也不再依赖 C++ 标准库，所以在 "
"Mac 和 HPC 上结果一致。测试会在 Linux 和 macOS 上检查结果是否一致。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:111
msgid "Tool config files: `config/*.cfg`"
msgstr "工具配置文件：`config/*.cfg`"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:113
msgid ""
"`cnetmcmc` reads most of its parameters from `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`, passed "
"with `--config_file` — see [MCMC configuration and trace files](../file-"
"formats/index.md#mcmc-configuration-and-trace-files) for its format. `bin"
"/run-cnetmcmc.sh` stops with an error if the file does not exist, because "
"`cnetmcmc` itself would silently fall back to its built-in defaults."
msgstr ""
"`cnetmcmc` 的大部分参数从 `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg` 读取，通过 `--config_file` 传入，格式见 [MCMC"
" 配置文件和 trace 文件](../file-formats/index.md#mcmc-configuration-and-trace-"
"files)。文件不存在时，`bin/run-cnetmcmc.sh` 会报错停止，因为 `cnetmcmc` 本身会不加提示地改用内置默认值。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:120
msgid ""
"A value given on the command line overrides the same key in the file. A "
"parameter the script passes explicitly — for example `--seed` or "
"`--is_total` — therefore cannot be changed from the config file; change it "
"in the script."
msgstr ""
"命令行上给出的值优先于文件中的同名 key。因此脚本显式传入的参数（例如 `--seed` 或 "
"`--is_total`）不能通过配置文件修改，要在脚本中改。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:125
msgid ""
"`cnets` and `cnetml` don't read a config file yet; they take all options as "
"command-line flags."
msgstr "`cnets` 和 `cnetml` 目前还不读取配置文件，所有参数都通过命令行传入。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:129
msgid ""
"`.conf` and `.cfg` files look alike but are not interchangeable. A `.cfg` "
"file is read by the program and accepts `dup_rate = 0.001`; a `.conf` file "
"is read by the shell, where the same line is an error. Keep the extension "
"that matches the reader."
msgstr ""
"`.conf` 和 `.cfg` 文件看起来相似，但不能互换。`.cfg` 文件由程序读取，可以写 `dup_rate = 0.001`；`.conf`"
" 文件由 shell 读取，同样一行会报错。请使用与读取方相符的扩展名。"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:135
msgid "Planned"
msgstr "计划中"

#: ../../source/configuration/index.md:137
msgid ""
"More config files are planned: one per tool (for `cnets` and `cnetml`) and "
"task-specific configurations. This page will describe them as they land."
msgstr "计划增加更多配置文件：每个工具一个（`cnets` 和 `cnetml`），以及针对特定任务的配置。添加后会在本页说明。"

